  "effect_entries": [],
  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "text": "ダイマックスした　ビークインが　つくる　ミツ。\nダイスープに　いれると　まろやかになる。\nげんきのかたまりと　おなじ　こうかも　ある。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "다이맥스한 비퀸이 만드는 꿀.\n다이수프에 넣으면 부드러워진다.\n기력의덩어리와 같은 효과도 있다.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "由極巨化的蜂女王製造的蜜汁。\n放進極巨湯裡，湯就會變得又甜又醇。\n也有與活力塊相同的效果。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Un miel crémeux produit par un Apireine Dynamax\nqui permet d’adoucir le goût de la Maxi Soupe.\nIl a également le même effet qu’un Rappel Max.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Honig, der von dynamaximierten Honweisel hergestellt\nwird und den Geschmack einer Dyna-Suppe abrundet.\nVerfügt über denselben Effekt wie Top-Beleber.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Panal construido por Vespiquen Dinamax cuya densa\nmiel suaviza el sabor de la Maxisopa. También tiene\nel mismo efecto que un Revivir Máximo.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Miele prodotto dai Vespiquen dynamaxizzati.\nSe aggiunto alla Zuppamax la rende molto saporita.\nHa anche gli stessi effetti di un Revitalizzante Max.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Honey that Dynamax Vespiquen produces. Adding this\nhoney to Max Soup makes the taste very smooth. It also\nhas the same effect as a Max Revive.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "ダイマックスした　ビークインが　作る　ミツ。\nダイスープに　入れると　まろやかになる。\nげんきのかたまりと　同じ　効果も　ある。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "极巨化的蜂女王制造出的蜜汁。\n放进极巨汤里，就能让汤的味道变得很温和。\n与活力块具有相同的效果。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Panal construido por Vespiquen Dinamax cuya densa\nmiel suaviza el sabor de la Maxisopa. También tiene\nel mismo efecto que un Revivir Máximo.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
